{
  "title": "Outstandingly Spicy Egyptian Potatoes Tagine",
  "description": "A spicy and pillowy Egyptian dish featuring Jersey Royal potatoes, perfect for a hangover cure, made with a shio-koji cure and shojin-friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
